，又恐琼楼玉宇，高处不胜寒。起舞弄清影，何似在人间。\n转朱阁，低绮户，照无眠。不应有恨，何事长向别时圆？人有悲欢离合，月有阴晴圆缺，此事古难全。但愿人长久，千里共婵娟。"],"usphone":"","ukphone":"","notation":"水调歌头·明月几时有 苏轼\n明月几时有，把酒问青天。不知天上宫阙，今夕是何年。我欲乘风归去，又恐琼楼玉宇，高处不胜寒。起舞弄清影，何似在人间。\n转朱阁，低绮户，照无眠。不应有恨，何事长向别时圆？人有悲欢离合，月有阴晴圆缺，此事古难全。但愿人长久，千里共婵娟。","units":[{"char":"水","code":"shui"},{"char":"调","code":"diao"},{"char":"歌","code":"ge"},{"char":"头","code":"tou"},{"char":"·","code":""},{"char":"明","code":"ming"},{"char":"月","code":"yue"},{"char":"几","code":"ji"},{"char":"时","code":"shi"},{"char":"有","code":"you"},{"char":" ","code":""},{"char":"苏","code":"su"},{"char":"轼","code":"shi"},{"char":"\n","code":""},{"char":"明","code":"ming"},{"char":"月","code":"yue"},{"char":"几","code":"ji"},{"char":"时","code":"shi"},{"char":"有","code":"you"},{"char":"，","code":""},{"char":"把","code":"ba"},{"char":"酒","code":"jiu"},{"char":"问","code":"wen"},{"char":"青","code":"qing"},{"char":"天","code":"tian"},{"char":"。","code":""},{"char":"不","code":"bu"},{"char":"知","code":"zhi"},{"char":"天","code":"tian"},{"char":"上","code":"shang"},{"char":"宫","code":"gong"},{"char":"阙","code":"que"},{"char":"，","code":""},{"char":"今","code":"jin"},{"char":"夕","code":"xi"},{"char":"是","code":"shi"},{"char":"何","code":"he"},{"char":"年","code":"nian"},{"char":"。","code":""},{"char":"我","code":"wo"},{"char":"欲","code":"yv"},{"char":"乘","code":"cheng"},{"char":"风","code":"feng"},{"char":"归","code":"gui"},{"char":"去","code":"qv"},{"char":"，","code":""},{"char":"又","code":"you"},{"char":"恐","code":"kong"},{"char":"琼","code":"qiong"},{"char":"楼","code":"lou"},{"char":"玉","code":"yv"},{"char":"宇","code":"yv"},{"char":"，","code":""},{"char":"高","code":"gao"},{"char":"处","code":"chu"},{"char":"不","code":"bu"},{"char":"胜","code":"sheng"},{"char":"寒","code":"han"},{"char":"。","code":""},{"char":"起","code":"qi"},{"char":"舞","code":"wu"},{"char":"弄","code":"nong"},{"char":"清","code":"qing"},{"char":"影","code":"ying"},{"char":"，","code":""},{"char":"何","code":"he"},{"char":"似","code":"si"},{"char":"在","code"